Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: marvell: add Yamaha RTX830

Describe the Yamaha RTX830 router based on the Marvell Armada 385.

Signed-off-by: Kosuke Shibuya <kakiringopcneko@gmail.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/arm/marvell/armada-38x.yaml        | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/marvell/armada-38x.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/marvell/armada-38x.yaml
@@ -67,4 +67,11 @@ properties:
           - const: marvell,armada385
           - const: marvell,armada380
 
+      - description:
+          Yamaha RTX830 router.
+        items:
+          - const: yamaha,rtx830
+          - const: marvell,armada385
+          - const: marvell,armada380
+
 additionalProperties: true
